# Lychee link-checker reviewed allowlist
# Every entry MUST have a comment explaining why it is excluded from checks.
# Changes to this file require maintainer review.

# Local addresses and non-routable host fixtures used in documentation examples
# Reason: Local test server URLs that are not active during static link checks
^http://localhost:[0-9]+
^http://127.0.0.1:[0-9]+

# Stellar testnet Friendbot query template
# Reason: Parameterized faucet URL with placeholder YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY_HERE intended for user replacement
^https://friendbot\.stellar\.org/\?addr=

# GitHub issue references and PR links
# Reason: Templates, issue trackers, and planned future milestones not yet created on GitHub
^https://github\.com/thegreatfeez/accord-protocol/issues
^https://github\.com/thegreatfeez/accord-protocol/pull

# Rate-limited third-party ecosystem documentation or explorer sites
# Reason: Cloudflare / DDoS guards on these third-party platforms block automated GitHub Actions IP ranges (HTTP 403)
^https://lab\.stellar\.org
^https://drips\.network/wave/stellar
^https://stellar\.expert

# Expected GitHub Pages published URL (not live until first deployment)
# Reason: Statically referenced expected deployment URL that will be live once GitHub Pages is enabled
^https://thegreatfeez\.github\.io/accord-protocol/
